    {
        "text": "My crazy ideas? You're the only drummer I know who can actually make them happen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#13$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You were the most hardworking drummer I have ever met.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#13$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "All you had to do... was be yourself, and nothing more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
