    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Felt real, didn't it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#18$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Falling straight to the ground from who knows how high up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#18$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, and then when the dream shattered and you were trapped in dreamless Limbo... how did <i>that</i> feel?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter how sweet those dreams were, they have to come to an end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You pry into their most fragile parts and dramatize them over and over...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Must say, I don't agree.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before you barged into their dreams uninvited, they'd all but forgotten about you and your insignificant little band.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ave{@nbs}Mujica is our contract. They entrusted their lives to me\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You were the only one who ever cared about it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you\u2014?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#18$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heard it for yourself, didn't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#15$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "One after another, they all rejected you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
