        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#7$3",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I gave everything I had for this... and now you're telling me it's all fake?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#2$4",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What a load of crap. I'm not accepting that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4185_amoris_1#2$4",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is my dream, and I don't need anyone else in it, thanks!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nyamu Y\u016btenji"
    },
