    },
    {
        "text": "I got to see every one of your sorriest, most helpless, most laughable moments.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#18$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You may have destroyed the dreams I spun, but I suppose this makes us even.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#18$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I have to thank you. You roamed their dreams again and again...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the process, proving to me that the dreamlands I wove were perfect, impeccable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And now, even that pest ought to admit it. It's me. I'm the most talented of us all in the Castle of Dreams.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Pest'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't you meet her in your dream?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The snooty girl? Flowery high-nobility frock? All the outdated pleasantries?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just being around her puts me ill at ease.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Iris is this place's master. You are nothing but a fraud!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "She said it! No matter how sweet the dream, one has to wake up in the end\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nngh\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sakiko feels her vocal cords freeze in place. She cannot make even the slightest peep."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#15$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know what? I finally understand why you get on my nerves so much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're just like her. You never listen to what others think. You just sit there spouting big, empty words forever.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You say they entrusted their lives to you, but let's be fair. You just don't want to be abandoned by others. Isn't that right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've seen your life. There's not much to it. Just a princess's stubborn struggle after her fall from grace.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Each and every action of yours was done to deceive and persuade yourself, and to present yourself as never having fallen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're self-important, conceited, and an utter lost cause.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#16$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What exactly does your band entail? Hmph. Just a bunch of girls using a so-called contract to bind one another for fun.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And now that they've all found happiness, of course they're abandoning you. Poor Sakiko Togawa. All alone once more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you really believe what Iris said, then fine, I'll prepare another round of the sweetest dreams for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It'll be perfect, impeccable. Realize it's a farce all you want, you still won't want to wake up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like your bandmates, you'll wallow in your dreams, unable to ever pluck yourself out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nngh\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Something to say? Alright, you get one last time. Speak your mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The impish girl draws a pattern in the air, and there is a sensation of chains falling away."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, the chains are pulled tight once again."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#19$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahahah-hah-hah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#18$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew it. You are <i>much</i> cuter when you're not talking!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "text": "As Sakiko struggles, Morpheus paces closer, step by step. Out reaches her right hand, and she places it on Sakiko's cheek."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#18$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "O ye, Princess of Hypocrisy. While you were on your dream tour, I've come to completely understand you as a person.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#18$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What you thirst for the most, what you need the most, and what you fear the most.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#18$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But don't worry. This dream? Will be absolutely perfect. You'll be more awake than ever. Not that you'll ever want to wake up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now sleep, my noble, selfish, conceited little doll girl.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1942_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sweet dreams.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morpheus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Clank, clunk."
    },
    {
        "text": "Sakiko? Sakiko!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm... hmm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "46_g1_transporter",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#4$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am NOT the kind of person you claim I\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sakiko bursts out yelling, but she is no longer in the castle, and Morpheus is nowhere to be found."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_290_vigna_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$mist_intro",
        "key": "$mist_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "You okay? You look terrible. You have another nightmare?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vigna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm... back in my dream again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_290_vigna_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you talking about? Didn't you just wake up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vigna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_290_vigna_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What, you sleep so long your brain's fuzzy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vigna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Iris and Bena are here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_338_iris_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er, how do you do... I don't believe I introduced myself?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iris"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_369_bena_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think she was already asleep when we got on?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Vigna and I aren't late... The dream has changed...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_290_vigna_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sakiko, you know, you keep saying some pretty weird stuff\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vigna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
