        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "We are heading to a small town in Victoria to find a girl named Ann who is acquainted with Iris.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "This vehicle will have a flat tire soon. We will be forced to get off to fix the tire, delaying us by a few hours...",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are we going to Victoria to find Ann?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_290_vigna_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's Ann? Do you know, Iris?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vigna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_338_iris_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't. Is that a friend of yours who lives there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iris"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What...? You don't know her, Iris?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then Vigna and I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_290_vigna_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh, hello? We're on a field mission not too far away from your home. I figured I'd bring you back for a break, let you see your family.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vigna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_290_vigna_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been mega busy with work. Gotta be a while since the last time you went home, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Vigna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$drift",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 2,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_338_iris_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's going on? Why did the car suddenly stop?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iris"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_369_bena_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did a tire burst?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "*huff*... *huff*... *pant*... Phew, we almost hit a burdenbeast!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Driver"
    },
    {
        "text": "That was close, but no worries. We can be back on the road right away!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Driver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sakiko Togawa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "As the engine starts humming again, the view outside the window begins to move once more."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
